title: MarcHouseMorning
---
{$protagName} stands in front of his bathroom mirror.
He has a determined look on his face as he holds a dark green tie in both hands, attempting to tie it around his neck.
He hopes that a tie would help make a good first impression, but he needs to learn how to tie it first before thinking ahead.
He gives the tie a few more tugs before it gives up and falls entirely onto his hands.

{$protagName}: *Sigh*, great.

{$protagName} didn’t have much hope in the tie, so he grabbed the green sweater next to him.
With the sweater in his left hand and the tie in his right, he thinks about what his best next move should be, until he hears something downstairs.

*Sizzle, sizzle, sizzle*

The sizzle he heard was far too familiar for {$protagName} to ignore.
He runs downstairs, still holding the sweater, too concerned about the sound to put it down.

{$protagName}: Out of all days!

//Scene 2
As {$protagName} turns into the kitchen, he sees a pot of water overboiling on the stove.
He looks around and sees no one else around to manage it.
Without thinking, he runs towards the stove and tries to shift the pot off the stove.
In his attempt, a stray drop of boiling water falls on his hand.

{$protagName}: SHIT!

{$protagName} quickly moves his hand away from the pot handle and looks at where he was splashed. A mark is already starting to show.

{$protagName}: *Sigh*, just my luck. Who was even down here to-

{$protagName} stops mid-thought and sees a note left on the counter.
He is too far away to see what it says, but the handwriting gives away that it came from his little brother {$brotherName}.
{$protagName} tosses his sweater on a chair and walks towards the sink.
He holds his hands underneath as he runs the cold water to hopefully make the burn mark stop swelling.

{$protagName} dries off his hand and picks up the note that {$brotherName} left him.

"Decided to make you coffee for your first day. You're welcome." -{$brotherName}

{$protagName}: I mean...at least he tried his best.

{$protagName} thinks about how {$brotherName}’s been doing. 
How much he’s grown in these past few years and wonder how much more he’ll grow as the years continue.
He looks at the pot and knows that {$brotherName} is trying his best, which is all that {$protagName} can ask for.

{$protagName} then grabs the sweater he threw and leaves home, walking towards the town square.

//Scene 3
As {$protagName} is walking, he looks around at the people around the town square. 
It was busy as usual, with people of different ages and backgrounds walking every which way. 
The slight breeze blowing by made the day seem less stressful, giving {$protagName} a bit more optimism.
{$protagName} finishes up his snack and pulls the sweater over himself. 
As he stands, he takes a deep breath. {$protagName} didn’t know what to expect at the museum, but he just had to hope things went smoothly.
{$protagName} starts making his way towards the museum for his first day.

===

title: MuseumIntro
tags:
---
<<set $protagName = "Marc">>
<<set $lover1Name = "Jovan">>
<<set $lover2Name = "Ruzica">>
<<declare $directorName = "Petar">>

<<oneChar>>
<<changeSprite 1 4>>
<<darken 1>>

{$protagName} looks around the museum in awe.
->So, this is the tree?
    {$protagName}: So, this is the tree?
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$directorName}: Congrats, you know what a tree is.
    <<darken 1>>
->You must be the manager?
    {$protagName}: You must be the manager?
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$directorName}: Yes, I am. You'd better show some respect.
    <<darken 1>>
-><i>Stay Silent</i>
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$directorName}: Well? Any thoughts rattling around up there?
    <<darken 1>>
{$directorName} gives {$protagName} a look.
<<lighten 1>>
{$directorName}: Do you even know why you're here?
<<darken 1>>
{$directorName} points at {$protagName}'s hand.
<<lighten 1>>
{$directorName}: And do I even want to know what happened there?
<<darken 1>>
{$protagName}: Siblings.
{$protagName} and {$directorName} stare at each other in awkward silence. {$protagName}, confused, clears his throat.
->I feel like I've done something wrong.
    {$protagName}: I feel like I've done something wrong.
    {$directorName} glares at {$protagName}, but says nothing.
->So, where should I get started?
    {$protagName}: So, where should I get started?
<<lighten 1>>
{$directorName}: Follow me to the <b>War Artifact</b> room.
<<darken 1>>

<<zeroChar>>
<color=\#7F7F7F>You can move to another room by tapping/clicking on the entrance.</color>
===
